      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5e44a1bd0c91c2477a8b8acb|full_name}: You can have as many layers as you want in base. The given example is just one use case off the top of my head, I can't see any reason why the option shouldn't be there for those who want to use it.\nSure, you could use anystate and parameter drivers but the point of the feature request is that it could in some cases offer a simpler and/or better alternative, and the functionality already exists.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
